.git
.gitignore
.venv
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
build
dist
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/.vite
# The end-to-end suite drives the built image's UI from outside; shipping it into
# the build context would only invalidate the frontend build layer on every spec
# edit. `tsconfig.e2e.json` is deliberately not a `tsc -b` reference, so the
# image's `npm run build` never looks for these files.
frontend/e2e
frontend/playwright.config.ts
playwright-report
test-results
blob-report
*.log
.env
.env.*
!frontend/.env.example
